  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Chapel inscription
  Body: 'Cut into the altar slab:


    WHAT WAS BARGAINED FOR NIGHT IS PAID IN BLOOD.
    WHAT WAS HIDDEN FROM HIM IS HIDDEN IN THREE: THE BLADE UNDER THE CRYPT, THE HILT
    AMONG THE STARS, THE STONE BEHIND A FACE.


    Bring them here and the altar
    remembers its trade.'
